Part IV : Conclusion
-------

With such a character, i thought everything was told. 

 - I pinpointed the exact level of the Wizard by using the mirror
     trick, and teleported there with a cursed scroll. My plan was as
     usual to go up one time first without the amulet, in order to
     find the stairs, and then to go back, take the amulet and so
     on...
 
  But ...

 - As i was still looking for my first stair up, i  walked on a
     land-mine, and the wizard wake up. Wouaouw ! I suddenly realized 
        = that i had to kill the wizard *know* and to find wy way up
          with the wizard after me :-(
        = that i had forgotten to wish for a ring of conflict :-(
        = that the wizard was able 
            + to move into it's pets
            + to *duplicate* hiself ! :-( :-( :-( !!!

    I had to face with 2 @-WoY and one x-WoY at the same time !!!

Anyway, I managed to killed them all (I was wearing my ring of
  teleport control and my ring of regeneration -- I had 8 food ration
  and 10 C-ration in my bag).

Last surprise : Do you know were were the stairs up ? ...
  On the small central island !


One more thing : (I think this is a minor *NEW* spoiler, since i don't
  have read it during the last 6 month, and it isn't in the WCST :

As I said, I killed the WoY in an "x" (xan) form. At this occasion, i
  got "The Amulet of Yandor". Fortunately, I had an identify scroll
  left, and as i was not sure, i identified the amulet, and it was a
  plastic imitation.  Then i killed the wizard on his "@" form, and
  got the real amulet. The interesting point is that, a few levels
  upper, i meat the WoY again, and he stole me the *cheap plastic*
  imitation of the amulet instead of the real one !!!!!
  This happend twice during my way up : The WoY never stole me back
  the AoY (Of course, i took again the plastic imitation as i killed
  the WoY).

I would have thought that the WoY would have been a bit more cleaver.

Question : was it luck, or is it an useful "feature" of the plastic
  imitations of the AoY ????





